SUMMARY:Family Day
DESCRIPTION:Family Day            \n                                \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Sundays\n11:00 am – 3:00 pm\nMakerspace\, Ground Floor\nFree for kids and included with admission for adults and seniors. \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Families can connect over clay in our new Makerspace with weekly activities inspired by our collection and special exhibitions\, and led by our amazing team of educators and volunteers. This season\, we invite you to get inspired by the springtime flora and fauna in our collections. Bring the whole family and let your creativity blossom with clay! \nWe recommend bringing a recycled container or bag in which to transport your work home. \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         
URL:https://www.gardinermuseum.on.ca/event/family-day-may-24-2026/
